<title>FRANCE: Schneider Q1 sales 10.61 billion francs.</title>
<headline>Schneider Q1 sales 10.61 billion francs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First three months of 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover:				     10,610    vs   10,293</p>
<p>     of which, Schneider Electric	   10,480    vs   10,173</p>
<p>		   Other				130     vs	120</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Schneider SA. The comparative figure for the first quarter of 1996 is after stripping out the turnover of Spie Batignolles, which was sold and of its thyratron invertor business, the company siad in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
